  "description": "Our Pad studios have been thoughtfully designed to provide a comfortable, private and contemporary living space. Each studio features a double bed, stylish ensuite bathroom, dedicated workspace and smart storage solutions, offering everything you need for convenient city living.\n\nAll-Inclusive Living\n\nYour monthly payment includes:\n\nHeating\nElectricity\nHigh-Speed WiFi\nWater & Refuse Collection\n\nHill Street House Features\n24/7 Concierge & Building Security\nFully Equipped Gym & Complimentary Fitness Classes\nWellness & Yoga Studio\nEntertainment Lounge & Cinema\nRooftop Terrace\nCo-Working Spaces\nResident Lounges\nChef-Inspired Communal Kitchens\nResident Events\nOn-Site Café\nSecure Bicycle Storage\n\nLocated in the heart of Dublin City, Hill Street House puts the very best of the capital on your doorstep. With excellent transport links and many of Dublin's leading employers, universities, cafés, restaurants and cultural attractions all within walking distance, it's the perfect place to live, work and connect.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you to the Hill Street House community.",
